{"speciesId":554,"names":{"fr":"Darumarond","es":"Darumaka","en":"Darumaka","ja":"ダルマッカ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand le feu brûle dans son corps, il est tout excité et court partout. Quand le feu s’apaise, il s’endort."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When its internal fire is burning, it cannot calm down and it runs around. When the fire diminishes, it falls asleep."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les gens d’autrefois avaient l’habitude de mettre ses crottes brûlantes sous leurs vêtements pour se réchauffer."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Darumaka’s droppings are hot, so people used to put them in their clothes to keep themselves warm."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When it sleeps, it pulls its limbs into its body and its internal fire goes down to 1,100° F."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When it sleeps, it pulls its limbs into its body and its internal fire goes down to 1,100° F."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les gens d’autrefois avaient l’habitude de mettre ses crottes brûlantes sous leurs vêtements pour se réchauffer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Como sus excrementos están muy calientes, la gente de antaño se los metía en los bolsillos para calentarse."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Darumaka’s droppings are hot, so people used to put them in their clothes to keep themselves warm."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ダルマッカの フンは 熱いので 昔の 人は 懐に 入れて 体を 温めていたのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand il dort, ses pattes se rétractent et les flammes qui brûlent à 600 °C dans son corps s’apaisent."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando se dispone a dormir, retrae sus piernas y sus brazos, y reduce la llama de su interior a 600 °C para relajarse."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When it sleeps, it pulls its limbs into its body and its internal fire goes down to 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"寝るときは 手足を ひっこめ 体内で 燃えている ６００度の 炎も 小さくなり 落ち着くよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les gens d’autrefois avaient l’habitude de mettre ses crottes brûlantes sous leurs vêtements pour se réchauffer."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Como sus excrementos están muy calientes, la gente de antaño se los metía en los bolsillos para calentarse."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Darumaka’s droppings are hot, so people used to put them in their clothes to keep themselves warm."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ダルマッカの フンは 熱いので 昔の 人は 懐に 入れて 体を 温めていたのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quand il dort, ses pattes se rétractent et les flammes qui brûlent à 600 °C dans son corps s’apaisent."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando se dispone a dormir, retrae sus piernas y sus brazos, y reduce la llama de su interior a 600 °C para relajarse."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When it sleeps, it pulls its limbs into its body and its internal fire goes down to 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"寝るときは 手足を ひっこめ 体内で 燃えている ６００度の 炎も 小さくなり 落ち着くよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"La flamme qui brûle dans son corps est sa source d’énergie. Si le feu s’affaiblit, il s’endort sur-le-champ."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"La llama que arde en su interior es la fuente de su poder. Si el fuego mengua, se sume en un estado de sopor de inmediato."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It derives its power from fire burning inside its body. If the fire dwindles, this Pokémon will immediately fall asleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体の 中で 燃える 炎が パワーの 源。 火が 小さく なると たちまち 眠ってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On a beau le pousser ou le tirer, quand il dort, rien ne le fait vaciller. Cette qualité lui a valu de devenir un emblème pour les porte-bonheurs."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando duerme es imposible tumbarlo por más que lo zarandeen. Es muy popular como amuleto de la suerte."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This popular symbol of good fortune will never fall over in its sleep, no matter how it’s pushed or pulled."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"寝ているときは 押しても 引いても けっして 倒れない。 縁起ものの モチーフとして 人気が 高い。"}],"varieties":[{"id":554,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[11,"level-up",22],[14,"level-up",22],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",22],[16,"level-up",22],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",22],[18,"level-up",22],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",28],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[11,"level-up",14],[14,"level-up",14],[15,"level-up",14],[16,"level-up",14],[17,"level-up",14],[18,"level-up",14],[20,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[11,"level-up",27],[14,"level-up",27],[15,"level-up",27],[16,"level-up",27],[17,"level-up",27],[18,"level-up",27],[20,"level-up",44]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[20,"level-up",8]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ember","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"